{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1379677-1001-cofd-plot-hooks","id":1379677,"title":"1001 CofD Plot Hooks","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-04-09T00:09:11-07:00","id":1379677,"title":"1001 CofD Plot Hooks","content":"This thread is a bunch of plot hooks for the Chronicles of Darkness setting that don't feel like they go into any of the other plot hook lists on this site for the setting.<br /> Sorry if that's a bit of a ramble &amp; you have to read it a few times to understand it. I know I would.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26055-krat05","name":"Krat05","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-09T00:09:44-07:00","id":1379680,"title":"","content":"1) A psychokinetic(or other Gifted) PI has come to a sleepy seaside town that has a cult worshipping a Thing That Should Not Be, &amp; population of Brineborn are also in the area. And then there's the case that brought the PI here in the first place. Add additional player characters as needed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26055-krat05","name":"Krat05","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-09T00:10:16-07:00","id":1379681,"title":"","content":"2) A motley group of supernaurals turn up in the city. They're a mix of vampires, werewolves, mages, &amp; others. You approach the ones of your supernatural type &amp; ask what is going on, what's up with this group.<br /> They're a squad from something military called Zero Company, &amp; they've got leave which they intend to enjoy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26055-krat05","name":"Krat05","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-09T00:10:56-07:00","id":1379682,"title":"","content":"3) You're a member of a supernatural group/society/culture/etc. A fairly normal one, &amp; everything's going swimmingly at the moment.<br /> Suddenly, two objects from the stars crash down in your area's effective backyard. At first it looks like a pair of extraterrestrial starships, both occupied during the &quot;landing&quot;.<br /> Then it's discovered that the first starship held a bunch of extraterrestrial supernatural creatures. The second starship held a group of hunters from an extraterrestrial species hunting the occupants of the first starship.<br /> This is massive.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26055-krat05","name":"Krat05","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-09T01:13:31-07:00","id":1379705,"title":"","content":"4) The vampires of the Ordo Dracul have opened a 24 hour Elysium and informed the rest of the supernatural community that their welcome to attend, discussions about making it safe for everyone are currently underway.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-09T05:07:16-07:00","id":1379732,"title":"","content":"6) Did you know, that Donald Trump has the power make duplicates of himself?<br /> That's how he's managed to become the POTUS &amp; the Brirish Prime Minister, at the same time!<br /> <br /> (This is referencing how similar Donald Trump &amp; Boris Johnson are, that I can see.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26055,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26055-krat05","user":"Krat05","date":". 04-19-2020, 07:29 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26055-krat05","name":"Krat05","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-09T08:49:26-07:00","id":1379771,"title":"","content":"7. A local LARP group has started organizing in a nearby park/bar. This wouldn't be a problem if it weren't for the fact that they aren't LARPers, they are what they are pretending to be and using the game as a cover for their group's activities.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25291-donteatrawhagis","name":"DontEatRawHagis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"211"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-09T09:04:48-07:00","id":1379775,"title":"","content":"8) Vampire attacks have increased in regularity in the city. Further investigation reveals that such attacks are not Vampires, but other supernatural creatures with similar M.O.s. Such as Cryptids created from Bats, Imperatives that increase the thirst of blood in Mortals, Bloodbather Immortal, etc... These creatures all seem independent from one another except for the fact that they are attracted to one particular blood bank.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25291-donteatrawhagis","name":"DontEatRawHagis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"211"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-09T13:15:43-07:00","id":1379853,"title":"","content":"9) A new school has opened. On paper it's for troubled teens. In reality it's for teens of supernatural leanings &amp; teens related to individuals of supernatural leanings. You or a close relative has gotten accepted into this new school.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26055-krat05","name":"Krat05","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-09T13:16:38-07:00","id":1379855,"title":"","content":"10) There's something sinister in the air &amp; everyone agrees that there's a great threat approaching the city.<br /> But everyone also agrees that they aren't going down without a fight.<br /> Truces are called between practically everyone as the wolves, the vampires, the hunters, the mages, &amp; all the rest make what preparations they can.<br /> There's a good chance this will cause the masquerade to be blown wide open, but there are worse ways for that to happen.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26055-krat05","name":"Krat05","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-10T19:00:53-07:00","id":1380263,"title":"","content":"11) A travelling priest claims to be able to &quot;cure&quot; people of supernatural &quot;afflictions&quot;. More specifically, the priest appears to be removing the downsides of the various supernatural &quot;afflictions&quot; whilst leaving behind any powers they've gotten as a consequence of the &quot;affliction&quot;.<br /> Some consider this awesome &amp; seek out the priest at the first opportunity. Others are offended, because it goes against what they believe in.<br /> And then the cured don't leave the priest, they find something about his presence to be safe.<br /> Then someone decides to go back to their family. Along the way, they notice they're being followed. It's the priest &amp; all his followers. And then the one that left the priest discovers that they need regular interactions with the priest, or the cure wears off.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26055-krat05","name":"Krat05","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-11T16:20:41-07:00","id":1380513,"title":"","content":"12) Not long ago, something caused a small number of doors to other, realms, realities, worlds, levels of existence.<br /> Your superiors, whoever they might be, have ordered you to claim one of these doors for the good of the organization to which you belong. This will, of course, involve fighting off all other potential claimants of the door whoever or whatever they may be, by any means necessary. Any questions?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26055-krat05","name":"Krat05","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-11T19:32:42-07:00","id":1380551,"title":"","content":"13) People report seeing a pack of shadowy, aggressive canines on the streets, late at night. No one can figure out where the canines disappear to during the day. And then, someone notices that the pack is growing...<br /> The canines are a pack of Beasts of Bethlehem that have been following something across the country.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26055-krat05","name":"Krat05","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-11T19:34:51-07:00","id":1380552,"title":"","content":"14) Some young willworker cast a very strange spell, dying in the process. No one figure out if the spell did what it was supposed to, but it's obvious that it did something. And what that something is, is that it brought a randomized bunch of monsters from a tabletop game bestiary (D&amp;D, Pathfinder, Starfinder, Shadowrun, Earthdawn, 13th Age, CthulhuTech, etc.) to life.<br /> At least there's a guidebook on how to kill, corral or otherwise subdue these things.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26055-krat05","name":"Krat05","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-11T21:09:46-07:00","id":1380574,"title":"","content":"15) Alien Invasion! And, due to distaste for the idea of &quot;evil aliens invading because their evil aliens&quot;, I've developed some reasons behind the invasion.<br /> \u25cf One of those deep space probes that Earth sent out was misinterpreted to be a declaration of war. They've come to say they've accepted.<br /> \u25cf This isn't strictly speaking an invasion. Several of their criminals have been hiding out here, using our (rather backwater by their standards) planet as a refuge. The (highly religious) aliens have also determined that there isn't any real people on our planet besides the criminals, so don't see any reason to hold back.<br /> \u25cf The aliens' society is divided into Houses, some more powerful than others. Power is determined by how much you can hold onto, by how much you can acquire &amp; subjugate, &amp; by what it precisely is that the House is holding onto. One or two Houses have noticed all the power (kindred, Uratha, willworkers, hunters with their Endowments, etc.) that can be found on our world, &amp; have decided to add that to their power bases.<br /> \u25cf The aliens are criminals that have decided our planet looks perfect to build a stronghold on.<br /> \u25cf The aliens have learned how to absorb DNA, adding it to their genetic wealth, &amp; then use that DNA to create stuff like specialized workers &amp; to augment their soldiers. There is a lot of interesting DNA on Earth (various supernatural creatures, whether this supernatural &quot;DNA&quot; can be added to the genetic bank is another question).<br /> \u25cf They're religious nutjobs, believing that all must convert to their faith &amp; experience eternal paradise, or perish &amp; face eternal damnation.<br /> \u25cf They've been here for years, quietly living their lives. Recent events have pisses them off, so their going to take over &amp; run things so much better.<br /> \u25cf They have a very limited diet. In fact, they only eat one plant-like thing. Our planet is swimming in a substance (you decide) that is very nutritional to this plant-like thing. They can make the entire planet into nothing but a garden for their food.<br /> \u25cf The aliens desire a slave race. After knocking us back to the stone age, we'll do.<br /> \u25cf They look at this planet &amp; see their version of Hell, a hotbed of ambition, malice, rapacity, &amp; zealotry. These foul, demonic creatures must not join the intergalactic races!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26055-krat05","name":"Krat05","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-12T18:49:30-07:00","id":1380819,"title":"","content":"16) Hunter, the latest triple A video game is a stealth action kill the monsters that will kick your ass in a straight fight and don\u2019t fight fair thing that might set the post Dark Souls difficult game trend.<br /> The problem is it has a lot of details about supernatural creatures far too close to the truth such as a vampires ability to hear your heartbeat.<br /> Also it doesn\u2019t hurt that your character is a capable woman who still has to work for her victories and hasn\u2019t set off claims that she\u2019s a Mary Sue and people are being directed to the game as how to solve the internet \u201cdebates\u201d about female representation so it\u2019s really trending on YouTube.<br /> Controls have a few too many context sensitive prompts and debates about how fair it\u2019s being are commonplace on line so it\u2019s not perfect.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-13T11:39:52-07:00","id":1381039,"title":"","content":"17) A serial killer has been removing the hearts of people for several months. Normally this wouldn't be something the Supernatural Community would take notice except that the last few victims have been powerful supernatural beings. Even Hunters have been targeted.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25291-donteatrawhagis","name":"DontEatRawHagis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"211"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-15T10:55:16-07:00","id":1381702,"title":"","content":"18) The leaders of the several supernatural communities have disappeared without a word. Though its weeks away from any formal planned meetings people are both suspicious and worried. With a little digging it becomes clear... they have gone on vacation together and a couple are having an illicit affair...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25291,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25291-donteatrawhagis","user":"DontEatRawHagis","date":". 04-17-2020, 11:31 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25291-donteatrawhagis","name":"DontEatRawHagis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"211"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-16T03:55:10-07:00","id":1381885,"title":"","content":"19) You wished for a more exciting life. Unfortunately, something capable of granting wishes heard you.<br /> Now you're being dragged into the various supernatural societies, &amp; there's no way out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26055-krat05","name":"Krat05","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-17T08:43:41-07:00","id":1382173,"title":"","content":"20) A Mortal con-man has been doing a perfect job of pretending to be various supernatural beings in the area. Suspiciously accurate, his antics have both been a good distraction, yet very concerning. Even the Hunters are kind of ticked off with him and are trying to figure out where he got all this information.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25291-donteatrawhagis","name":"DontEatRawHagis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"211"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-23T05:51:42-07:00","id":1383336,"title":"","content":"21) You're an assortment of supernaturals with no memory of how you got on what looks like a starship.<br /> Also, it looks like the starship is on its very last legs.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26055-krat05","name":"Krat05","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-23T05:52:26-07:00","id":1383338,"title":"","content":"22) Three individuals descended from the heavens. They called themselves the Sky Father, the Ocean King, &amp; the Death Lord, &amp; referred to each other as &quot;brother&quot;.<br /> They proclaimed that they were the first of the gods returned to rule us once again because we are apparently rather shit at ruling ourselves.<br /> Oh, &amp; they're also sociopathic assholes.<br /> Plus, the rest of the gods are also returning, these three were just a bit quicker by virtue of being the top gods.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26055-krat05","name":"Krat05","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-23T05:52:57-07:00","id":1383339,"title":"","content":"23) You were just having a laugh when you made it up. A freshly-made, spooky urban legend to tell your friends late at night.<br /> Then you discovered a murdered corpse. Where you found it, the location, shape, &amp; orientationof the wounds.<br /> But how can this be? You'd only just told your friends a couple of nights ago, &amp; there's no record of it beyond memory!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26055-krat05","name":"Krat05","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-27T18:39:06-07:00","id":1384321,"title":"","content":"24) The local Carthian Movement, Free Council, &amp; Iron Masters have put aside their differences &amp; bonded over their similarities. They mean to take control of the city between themselves. You find yourself stuck in the middle of this situation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26055-krat05","name":"Krat05","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-27T20:25:27-07:00","id":1384347,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Krat05</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1379677-1001-cofd-plot-hooks?p=1384321#post1384321\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">24) The local Carthian Movement, Free Council, &amp; Iron Masters have put aside their differences &amp; bonded over their similarities. They mean to take control of the city between themselves. You find yourself stuck in the middle of this situation.</div> </div> </div> </div>It sounds as creation of local <i>Ship of Theseus</i> Sworn group from <b>Contagion Chronicle</b> - like literal backstory of it. Just add some Contagion in the background and you have this like coming from <b>CC</b> book pages... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-27T21:17:04-07:00","id":1384350,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1379677-1001-cofd-plot-hooks?p=1384347#post1384347\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It sounds as creation of local <i>Ship of Theseus</i> Sworn group from <b>Contagion Chronicle</b> - like literal backstory of it. Just add some Contagion in the background and you have this like coming from <b>CC</b> book pages... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Really? Well I haven't gotten around to reading any of the Contagion Chronicles in any great depth.<br /> I know of the False &amp; the Sworn (but not the individual groups under these two headings) &amp; the basic difference between them.<br /> I know of that the Contagion isn't a single, supernatural infection that threatens all every so often.<br /> And that's pretty much all my knowledge on the subject at the moment.<br /> So any similarities? Purely coincidental.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26055-krat05","name":"Krat05","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-28T00:01:56-07:00","id":1384370,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Krat05</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1379677-1001-cofd-plot-hooks?p=1384350#post1384350\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So any similarities? Purely coincidental.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's because Sworn and False groups as written as logical extensions of possible crossover alliances. Here are few quotes from <i>Ship of Theseus </i>( KS Preview version ):<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Our kind have been around for a long time. Haven\u2019t you noticed how much harder it is to get by, how much more work it takes now to stick to the shadows? We\u2019ve become complacent. Humans evolve over centuries; why would we be any different? But we resist. We stick to our traditions and old ways, assuming that our predecessors knew best while the world of today leaves us behind. The New marches on while the Old plants its feet, and the friction between them \u2014 the sparks that fly \u2014 that\u2019s the Contagion. The gears are grinding against unyielding stone. We must be not as stone but as water, flowing and changing.<br /> (...)<br /> What we stand to gain: Progress. Rebirth. A new beginning, and freedom from these glitches that plague us. If we can learn to evolve, to grow and change, we\u2019ll reach the pinnacle of what we are and transcend it into something more. Something better. Call it New Dawn, Apotheosis, Hell, whatever you like \u2014 just don\u2019t call it out of reach. We blaze the trail and leave breadcrumbs for the other Sworn to follow.<br /> (...)<br /> Pockets of us with similar beliefs cropped up from time to time during localized outbreaks, among such groups as alchemists, Buddhists, Hindus, futurists, and rebels. These pockets disbanded once their respective crises ended, but their accumulated wisdom slowly circulated among their spiritual successors with each subsequent outbreak. We convened as true Sworn during the serious one in the mid-19th century, while the works of Chambers and Darwin circulated madly throughout the Western world. Debates raged among us: were we evolving too? Should we adapt, or was adaptation just another word for becoming Contagious?<br /> (...)<br /> Each outbreak heralds a new step in supernatural evolution. It\u2019s a sign that a reckoning is coming for us Sworn, one that decides who transcends and who is destroyed in the aftermath. We study our apotheosis myths for commonalities, and pursue them together. Our Created like to say we\u2019re all embarking on a collective Great Work, and we seek out Firestorms deliberately to watch them wreak their glorious havoc. We fund Ordo Dracul experiments, hunt down Sariras, help our Begotten claim hives and establish Myths, and anything else we can do to push each other along our respective journeys to revolution and revelation. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-29T16:45:26-07:00","id":1384736,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DontEatRawHagis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1379677-1001-cofd-plot-hooks?p=1381702#post1381702\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">18) The leaders of the several supernatural communities have disappeared without a word. Though its weeks away from any formal planned meetings people are both suspicious and worried. With a little digging it becomes clear... they have gone on vacation together and a couple are having an illicit affair...</div> </div> </div> </div>18-A) Despite the info gathered, the exact location of the group holiday is, beyond it being somewhere in the [Insert-Tropical-Area/Region/Country/Whatever], along with the identities of the lovers (and, indeed, anything beyond the affairs existence) are unknown. The PC Troupe has been assembled/chosen* to find the leaders and get some dirt on the couple.<br /> <br /> *Depending on ST fiat as necessary.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-10T03:49:31-07:00","id":1387232,"title":"","content":"25) The region was very quiet on the supernatural front. Very quiet. Then an explosion of energy hit the region. Now supernatural activity is on a steady rise, &amp; doesn't look to be slowing down or stopping any time soon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26055-krat05","name":"Krat05","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-10T03:50:03-07:00","id":1387233,"title":"","content":"26) Any of the splats/gamelines/etc. dealing with Covid-19 or some other disease of equal severity.<br /> Note that this disease should be non-supernatural &amp; not be a Contagion (possibly, I don't actually know what the qualifies a disease as a possible Contagion, but I'd like to keep away from this being automatically a Contagion).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26055-krat05","name":"Krat05","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-10T17:20:35-07:00","id":1387368,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Krat05</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1379677-1001-cofd-plot-hooks?p=1387233#post1387233\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">26) Any of the splats/gamelines/etc. dealing with Covid-19 or some other disease of equal severity.<br /> Note that this disease should be non-supernatural &amp; not be a Contagion (possibly, I don't actually know what the qualifies a disease as a possible Contagion, but I'd like to keep away from this being automatically a Contagion).</div> </div> </div> </div>It\u2019d certainly make covering up their activities harder, and they\u2019d have to become more reliant on technology to stay in contact without blowing their covers (or Covers, in the case of the Unchained).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-25T01:28:52-07:00","id":1391441,"title":"","content":"27) A bunch of people get hit by a surge of energy. This causes them to, at random times, in one group, enter some other place &amp;/or time. Quickly establishing that any injuries they incur while in one of these other places/times, you must survive wherever you find yourselves in &amp; search for a way to stop this from happening.<br /> \u25cf I'm primarily looking at Dark Eras for these other places/times, but not limiting myself to that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26055-krat05","name":"Krat05","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-24T21:35:07-07:00","id":1420072,"title":"","content":"28) You live in a rural community, where everyone knows everyone. One morning, someone turns up dead. Murdered. Tensions start to rise as the investigation progresses. Then you or one of your friends discovers something very chilling.<br /> Every 100 years, the town is gripped by an insidious madness that makes the residents homicidally insane. But the time each &quot;season of slaughter&quot; ends, the population has been approximately halved.<br /> You check your calendar &amp; find that it's time for the season to begin. And how do you know that you haven't been effected?<br /> <br /> \u25cf Two adjustments: the length of time between each season of slaughter, &amp; the number of murders it causes.<br /> \u25cf Two questions for if you want something other than just a massacre: Why is this happening? How has this gone unnoticed for so long?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26055,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26055-krat05","user":"Krat05","date":". 10-25-2020, 12:52 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26055-krat05","name":"Krat05","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-17T02:45:49-07:00","id":1476562,"title":"","content":"29) Going through a collection of old photos from your childhood you come across something rather interesting. A picture of you with your identical twin dressed in identical clothes. Thing is, you were pretty sure you were an only child.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26055-krat05","name":"Krat05","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-07T06:04:12-07:00","id":1478203,"title":"","content":"30) A crack opens from the ground and fire erupts from it. A massive demon emerges, just to beg for the player characters' protection. Is the demon being sincere? And, perhaps more importantly, just what could be terrifying enough to scare a massive demon?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23983-xela_nut","name":"xela_nut","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23983_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"91"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}